window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>King Gohdin has reawakened. His rule over Surton Spire and the monsters within has sown the seeds of a new world. As the Protharian Empire celebrates the return of Griffon Nodure as the Sole Survivor, the Emperor dispatches forces north to uncover those responsible for slaughtering the barbarian invaders.</p> <p>Christoph Gildenson, within the body of the Gohdin, must choose the path he will walk. As king of the monsters, he intends to limit his subjects and prevent more loss of human life. He must learn to control his magic and wield the power of his crown to keep chaos from spreading through the lands.</p> <p>Continue the tale of Gohdin. Dragonkin. King. Lich.</p> <p>Destined Blades march upon his gates, and humanity breaks the silence cast over Surton Spire. If Christoph is to become a good man, and a good king, he must reveal himself... and his kingdom... to the world.</p>"; 
